    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in green pepper and mushrooms; cook for a few minutes. Add tomatoes with juice, spaghetti, and water; stir well. Add Italian seasoning, salt, and pepper. Cook for about 15 minutes, stirring occasionally, until spaghetti is tender. Add mozzarella cheese and stir until melted.",
